{"title": "The Spectator Eyes", "pageid": 7940, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/The_Spectator_Eyes", "categories": ["Amulets", "Very rare items", "Sources of Necrotic damage", "Necrotic set"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-veryrare\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Faded.png/300px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/7/7f/Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"The Spectator Eyes image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7f/Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Faded.png/300px-Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7f/Amulet_Necklace_A_Bronze_A_1_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">The Spectator Eyes</span></a> is a very rare <a href=\"/wiki/Amulets\" title=\"Amulets\">Amulet</a> that allows the wearer to cast <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ray_of_Fear\" title=\"Ray of Fear\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ray of Fear\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/3a/Generic_Control_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ray_of_Fear\" title=\"Ray of Fear\">Ray of Fear</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wounding_Ray\" title=\"Wounding Ray\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wounding Ray\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp/20px-Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Generic_Necrotic_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wounding_Ray\" title=\"Wounding Ray\">Wounding Ray</a> once per Long Rest.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Spectators are hideous aberrations that float above the ground, fiercely staring around and shooting beams at anything they don't appreciate.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Amulets\" title=\"Amulets\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png/25px-Amulets_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png/38px-Amulets_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png/50px-Amulets_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Amulets\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png/25px-Amulets_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e5/Amulets_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Amulets\" title=\"Amulets\">Amulets</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Very rare\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #D1017B ;\">Very rare</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 360 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  360  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_SpectatorEye_Amulet</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_SpectatorEye_Amulet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"norefer